572	     * Emits the immutable structured {@code OWNER_CREATED} event to the {@code AUDIT} logger as a
573	     * compact JSON object {@code {seq, ownerId, memberId, membershipLevel, event}}. {@code seq}
574	     * is a process-wide monotonically increasing sequence across creates. The event carries the
575	     * owner's current primary identifier via {@link #primaryIdentifier(Owner)} — the memberId — so
576	     * consumers always see the identifier in force.
577	     */
